#!/usr/bin/env dash

cat <<EOF
SUPER + Return        → Open terminal (Foot)
SUPER + D             → App launcher (Tofi)
SUPER + B             → Browser (LibreWolf)
SUPER + E             → File manager (PCManFM)
SUPER + .             → Emoji picker (rofi)
SUPER + Shift + V     → Clipboard manager (Cliphist)
SUPER + W             → Toggle Waybar
SUPER + S             → Screenshot region to clipboard
SUPER + Shift + S     → Screenshot output to clipboard
SUPER + Shift + P     → Power menu
SUPER + + Shift + N   → Toggle blue light filter
SUPER + Left          → Brightness down
SUPER + Right         → Brightness up
SUPER + Down          → Volume down
SUPER + Up            → Volume up
SUPER + Shift + M     → Mute / unmute
XF86AudioLowerVolume  → Volume down
XF86AudioRaiseVolume  → Volume up
XF86AudioMute         → Mute / unmute
SUPER + F             → Toggle fullscreen
SUPER + Shift + C     → Kill focused window
SUPER + Shift + SPACE → Toggle floating
SUPER + Left Click    → Move window
SUPER + Right Click   → Resize window
SUPER + H             → Resize left
SUPER + J             → Focus down
SUPER + K             → Focus up
SUPER + L             → Resize right
SUPER + Shift + J     → Move window down
SUPER + Shift + K     → Move window up
SUPER + 1–9           → Switch to tag 1–9
SUPER + Shift + 1–9   → Move window to tag 1–9
EOF
